BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:friday-the-13th-20261113@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
SUMMARY:Friday the 13th
DESCRIPTION:Friday the 13th is the date most Americans know to be unlucky\,
  and nearly everything commonly said about where it came from is wrong. It
  is not medieval\, it has no demonstrable link to the Knights Templar\, an
 d Library of Congress folklorists trace the belief no further back than 18
 30s France. Every year holds at least one and never more than three\; 2026
  has three.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/friday-the-13th/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/friday-the-13th/
CATEGORIES:Celebration
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
